stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CallingModel
    CallingModel --> ExecutingTool: 恰好一个 ToolCall
    ExecutingTool --> CallingModel: ToolResult（成功或失败都算观察）
    CallingModel --> Completed: 非空最终文本
    CallingModel --> BudgetExhausted: 达到 max_steps / max_tool_calls
    CallingModel --> AmbiguousToolRequest: 一轮出现多个 ToolCall
    CallingModel --> UnrecognizedAction: 解码失败，或既非工具也非文本
